<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cotización USD/VES - Tasa BCV Oficial</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/inter@5.0.8/index.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/plus-jakarta-sans@1.1.0/index.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 50%, #0f172a 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .bg-pattern {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            opacity: 0.03;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 25% 25%, #fbbf24 1px, transparent 1px),
                radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, #3b82f6 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 50px 50px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 480px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px 16px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding-top: 10px;
        }

        .header-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .header-badge .dot {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-dot {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #94a3b8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .rate-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1));
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .rate-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            right: -50%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08), transparent);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .rate-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .rate-date {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .rate-value-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .rate-value {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .rate-currency {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .rate-pair {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .rate-pair span {
            color: #fbbf24;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .converter-card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .converter-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .converter-title svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
        }

        .input-group {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .input-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .input-label span {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .input-label .currency-tag {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3);
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .input-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-wrapper .prefix {
            position: absolute;
            left: 16px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .input-field {
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 16px 16px 36px;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .input-field:focus {
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
        }

        .input-field::placeholder {
            color: #334155;
        }

        .swap-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #6366f1);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: -6px auto 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .swap-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        }

        .swap-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        .swap-btn svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            color: white;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .swap-btn:hover svg {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }

        .result-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05));
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .result-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #22c55e;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .result-value {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #4ade80;
        }

        .result-detail {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .quick-amounts {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .quick-btn {
            background: rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px 4px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #94a3b8;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        .quick-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            color: #60a5fa;
        }

        .quick-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        .info-section {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.2);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .info-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .info-item {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .info-item-label {
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: #475569;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .info-item-value {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        .refresh-btn {
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .refresh-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        }

        .refresh-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .refresh-btn svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .refresh-btn:hover svg {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #475569;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .toast {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-100px);
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
            border: 1px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 100;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .toast.show {
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
        }

        .toast .toast-icon {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .manual-rate-section {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding-top: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.2);
        }

        .manual-rate-toggle {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 8px 0;
        }

        .manual-rate-toggle span {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .toggle-switch {
            width: 40px;
            height: 22px;
            background: rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.4);
            border-radius: 11px;
            position: relative;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .toggle-switch.active {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
        }

        .toggle-switch::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 2px;
            left: 2px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .toggle-switch.active::after {
            transform: translateX(18px);
        }

        .manual-input-group {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 12px;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .manual-input-group.show {
            display: flex;
        }

        .manual-input {
            flex: 1;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .manual-input:focus {
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
        }

        .manual-apply-btn {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #60a5fa;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .manual-apply-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .history-section {
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .history-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.15);
        }

        .history-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .history-date {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .history-rate {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        .loading-shimmer {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.2) 25%, rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3) 50%, rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.2) 75%);
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: transparent !important;
        }

        @keyframes shimmer {
            0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
            100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .animate-in {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease forwards;
        }

        .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; opacity: 0; }
        .delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; opacity: 0; }
        .delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; opacity: 0; }
        .delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; opacity: 0; }

        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .rate-value {
                font-size: 34px;
            }
            .input-field {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
            .result-value {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .quick-amounts {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-pattern"></div>
    <div class="toast" id="toast">
        <div class="toast-icon">
            <svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span id="toast-msg">Tasa actualizada correctamente</span>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header animate-in">
            <div class="header-badge">
                <span class="dot"></span>
                Tasa Oficial BCV
            </div>
            <h1>Cotizador USD / VES</h1>
            <p>Dólar estadounidense → Bolívar venezolano</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rate-card animate-in delay-1">
            <div class="rate-label">Tasa de cambio oficial</div>
            <div class="rate-date" id="rate-date">Cargando fecha...</div>
            <div class="rate-value-container">
                <span class="rate-value" id="rate-display">--</span>
                <span class="rate-currency">VES</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rate-pair">por <span>1 USD</span></div>

            <div class="manual-rate-section">
                <div class="manual-rate-toggle" id="manual-toggle">
                    <span>📝 Ingresar tasa manualmente</span>
                    <div class="toggle-switch" id="toggle-switch"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="manual-input-group" id="manual-group">
                    <input type="number" class="manual-input" id="manual-rate-input" placeholder="Ej: 36.50" step="0.01" min="0">
                    <button class="manual-apply-btn" id="manual-apply">Aplicar</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="converter-card animate-in delay-2">
            <div class="converter-title">
                <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                Calculadora de conversión
            </div>

            <div class="input-group">
                <div class="input-label">
                    <span id="from-label">Monto en Dólares (USD)</span>
                    <div class="currency-tag" id="from-tag">🇺🇸 USD</div>
                </div>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
            
